        "cooked": "<p>the board game geek video was great, but long enough that I found myself wishing there was a shorter way to introduce people to the game.</p>\n<p>So I made one:</p>\n<div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"YtM4idwHEK4\" data-video-title=\"Sentinels of the Multiverse\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YtM4idwHEK4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7ff0dcf2df13e62c86d854968061e9201295bd64.jpeg\" title=\"Sentinels of the Multiverse\" data-dominant-color=\"A08A6F\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<p>It’s got more problems than pluses, but the perfect is the enemy of the good.</p>",
